# Map V3 orbit trails

Before changing orbit trail rendering or planet/moon orbit builders:

1. Read **`docs/ORBIT_TRAIL_DRAWING_GUIDE.md`** — especially **§2 Motion tail** (faint prograde lead 0.25, bold trailing attach 1.0, linear ramp in prograde order on one closed ring).
2. Prefer **`opacityForOrbitTailAhead`** / **`closedRingHalfGradientOpacities`** for closed rings; do not reintroduce full-ring symmetric opacity (`trailVertexOpacitiesKspRing`) or retro-only flat dimming mid-orbit.
3. Default new solar-map features to **Map V3** (`3d-v3`, `web/src/scene/v3/`, `web/src/map-v3/`). Keep v1/v2 changes minimal (regression only).
4. Update **`docs/MAP_V3_RENDERING_GUIDE.md`** and run **`npm test`** when behavior changes.

Program state: **`docs/MAP_V3_PROGRAM_STATE.md`**.
